    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2076" root="بذأ" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذِىْءٌ</span></b>  A man <i>foul, unseemly,</i> or <i>obscene,</i> (T,

M, K, TA,) <i>in tongue;</i> (TA;) <i>evil in speech.</i>
(T.) [See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بذو</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A place <i>in which is
no pasture:</i> (K:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ بَذِيْئَةٌ</span> <i>a land in which
is no pasture.</i> (S, M.)

